ly is an open-source app built with React-Native. You can find its source code on GitHub (https://github.com/mmazzarolo/breathly-app).\n\nFeedback is welcomed!","title":null,"story_id":26680381,"story_title":"Show HN: Open-source breath training and relaxation app","story_score":1,"comments":0,"w":0,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"breathly"}